---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import metadata from './metadata';
---
<ArticleLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <p>Some days the quickest way to find a design is to throw a few versions at the wall
    and see what sticks. Make the heading too big, try the ridiculous colour, move the
    whole thing to the other side. A rough page gives you something concrete to argue
    with, which is much more useful than a perfect idea that only exists in your head.
    Keep the bit that works, bin the rest, and have another go.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
